SELECT t.id, cr.id, 2, E'*Our soul waiteth for Yahuah (LORD): he is our help and our shield* (Psalm 33:20) — the *name of the Elohim of Jacob* the king''s defence (20:1) is Yahuah Himself, the help and the shield.'
