--        NT:     ★★ James 1:25 (the perfect law of liberty); ★ James 2:12 (judged by the law of liberty); ★ John 8:31-32,36 (the truth shall make you free) — THREAD 5
--        Extras: none warranted        Tanakh: none warranted (the liberty-inversion is the NT weave) — THREAD 5
--   v.89 + v.152,v.160 (For ever, O Yahuah, thy word is settled in heaven / thy word is true from the beginning... endureth for ever)
--        NT:     ★★ Matthew 5:18 (one jot or one tittle shall in no wise pass); ★ 1 Peter 1:25 (the word of the Lord endureth for ever) — THREAD 6
--        Extras: ★ Baruch 4:1 (the law that endureth for ever) — THREAD 6
--        Tanakh: ★ Isaiah 40:8 (the word of our Elohim shall stand for ever); ★ Psalm 111:7-8 (his commandments... stand fast for ever) — THREAD 6 (anti-antinomian keystone)
--   v.97 + v.103,v.113,v.127 (O how love I thy law! ...sweeter than honey... I love thy commandments above gold)
