--        Extras: none warranted (Sirach love-of-wisdom held to #4)        Tanakh: ★ Psalm 19:10 (sweeter also than honey) — THREAD 7
--   v.105 (Thy word is a lamp unto my feet, and a light unto my path)
--        NT:     ★★ 2 Peter 1:19 (a light that shineth in a dark place); ★★ John 8:12 (I am the light of the world) — THREAD 8
