--   v.176 (I have gone astray like a lost sheep; seek thy servant; for I do not forget thy commandments)
--        NT:     ★★ Luke 15:4-6 (the lost sheep sought); ★ Matthew 18:12 (seeketh that which is gone astray) — THREAD 11
--        Extras: none warranted        Tanakh: ★★ Isaiah 53:6 (all we like sheep have gone astray); ★★ Ezekiel 34:11-16 (I will seek my sheep — two-house Shepherd) — THREAD 11
--   vv.67,71,75 (Before I was afflicted I went astray... It is good for me that I have been afflicted; that I might learn thy statutes)
