--   5. psalm-119-i-will-walk-at-liberty-the-perfect-law-of-liberty — NT (James 1, James 2, John 8) [free]
--   6. psalm-119-thy-word-is-settled-in-heaven-for-ever — NT (Matthew 5, 1 Peter 1) + Extras (Baruch 4) + Tanakh (Isaiah 40, Psalm 111) [extras] ★★ anti-antinomian keystone
